ManiGuard-Bench task files (scene_ep1.json, diagnostics.jsonl)

The files scene_ep1.json and diagnostics.jsonl under scripts/maniguard/instances/<family>/<task>/ (and their copies in the
generated task directories tasks/maniguard-*/.../instance/) are the base level of the listed ManiGuard-Bench tasks, copied
unchanged from

  IDEAS-Lab-Northwestern/ManiGuard-Bench (Hugging Face dataset), revision af09438cebcd8f532e82cb5302701173ebb59f6e
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/IDEAS-Lab-Northwestern/ManiGuard-Bench
  path: <family>/<task>/base/{scene_ep1.json, diagnostics.jsonl}

